PianoSensors is UniXNU-piano's sensor package (BSD-2-Clause-Patent, LICENSE) built on the portable protocol code of PaganiSensors, the
UniXNU community's sensor driver for another SM8750 device (OnePlus 13T, iOS). What it takes from other work, and from where:

UniXNU-Pagani-Drivers (github.com/Shad0w23333/UniXNU-Pagani-Drivers, 3d570b7653bf9831def8fe49b339b42990508d83, the revision the UniXNU
board record for that device names), BSD-2-Clause-Patent (LICENSE sha256 5b1d3d911103cb0f41641ec0964c5ac1f7e229f57aa072b6ac38bae913a1307b,
the same text as UniXNU-sheng's). Host-tested there only ("nothing here has met the hardware yet"); its facts come from Qualcomm's BSD-3
sources (qualcomm/sensinghub, qualcomm/fastrpc), Linux and hexagonrpc read for facts only. drivers/PaganiSensors/:
